{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/138002-gencon-the-dead-gamer-s-society-the-wrecking-crew-events","id":138002,"title":"Gencon: The Dead Gamer's Society & The Wrecking Crew Events","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-15T06:12:47-07:00","id":138002,"title":"Gencon: The Dead Gamer's Society & The Wrecking Crew Events","content":"This year The Dead Gamer's Society &amp; The Wrecking Crew are teaming up to provide table-top events to Gencon attendees. For those attending Nerdvanna these are some table-top events that I will be hosting &amp; running. Im including the relevant info for you to sign up early:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The Dead Gamer's Society &amp; Wrecking Crew's GenCon 2014 Events</span></b><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">SEM1454731 How to Get Involved In Running Events at Conventions Sat @ 3:00 PM 1 hrs Location: Crowne Plaza :: Pennsylvania Stn B Cost: $0 </span></b><br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">SEM1454732 How to Be Successful Running Events at Gen Con or An... Sat @ 4:00 PM 2 hrs Location: Crowne Plaza :: Pennsylvania Stn B Cost: $0</span></b></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\">RPG1454861</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><i>&quot;Denn die Todten Reiten Schnell&quot;</i> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"> (For the Dead Travel Fast) </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\">Thu @ 5:00 PM</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\">5 hrs</span></span></span></b> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">The Prince's spiritual advisor and confessor, a powerful Lancea Sanctum Ancilla, has hired you to transport them out of the city. You are part of a unique cadre of Nomad Kindred: The Brides of Dracula. Astride your motorcycles you travel the perilous roads to take your charge safely to their destination. What secrets has this confessor uncovered? And why is this Elder so ready and willing to leave everything they has toiled to accomplish in the last century of their Requiem? What does it flee? </span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\">RPG1454743</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\">Last Voyage of the Medusa</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\">Fri @ 10:00 AM</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\">5 hrs</span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">The New World! You and your Coterie flee from the fires of the Spanish Inquisition aboard the caravelle Medusa. You flee not only the flames of Vampire hunters but the retribution of the Primogen of Lisbon, after delivering the Final Death to its tyrannical Prince. You have provisioned the ship to take you across the long voyage to Sao Paulo, in the colony of Brazil. However, something has stowed away in your ship and the crewmen whisper about \u2018winged spirits\u2019 that drive men mad. It is 6 nights before you make landfall, but the crew are dying faster each day and you must safeguard your food... </span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\">RPG1454865</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\">The Curse of the Mummy</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\">Sat @ 2:00 PM</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\">5 hrs</span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Your cult laid you to rest centuries ago, guarding your precious relics, artifacts, treasures..</span><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">. But something awakens you and drags you from your dreams of lost Irem...</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">The year is 1922. Your tomb, somewhere in the slums of Cairo, Egypt, has been invaded and the tomb robbers seek something hidden by your cult. Problem is, you cannot remember where they put it. This is an introductory game which teaches the new concepts in Mummy the Curse. Character creation will be an option for new players and pre-gens will be provided if requested.</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":311,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","user":"JoeB","date":". 05-21-2014, 08:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T05:35:22-07:00","id":139210,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\">Here is the complete list of sponsored by The Dead Gamer's Society &amp; The Wrecking Crew:</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\">RPG1454737 Operation St. Germaine, Ro